### Create Request – DUPLICATE identifier (409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001",
  "type": "technical_support",
  "requester_name": "Test User",
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "description": "Intento de duplicar el identificador 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001",
  "priority": "low"
}

###

### Create Request – Invalid email (422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_id": "EXT-ERR-001",
  "type": "technical_support",
  "requester_name": "Test User",
  "email": "esto-no-es-un-correo",
  "description": "Descripción lo suficientemente larga para pasar la validación mínima",
  "priority": "high"
}

###

### Create Request – Invalid catalog value (422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_id": "EXT-ERR-002",
  "type": "tipo_que_no_existe",
  "requester_name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "description": "Descripción lo suficientemente larga para pasar la validación mínima",
  "priority": "high"
}

###

### List all requests
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests
Accept: application/json

###

### List requests – filter by estado
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests?status=received
Accept: application/json

###

### List requests – filter by tipo and prioridad
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests?type=technical_support&priority=high
Accept: application/json

###

### Get specific request – replace <id> with a real UUID from POST response
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests/<id>
Accept: application/json

###

### Get request – non-existent UUID (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### Update estado → en_proceso (replace <id> with a real UUID)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests/<id>/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

###

### Update estado → completada
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests/<id>/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

###

### Update estado – invalid value (422 Unprocessable Entity)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests/<id>/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pendiente"
}
